`activeSessions/{uid}`

Fields:
- uid
- workspaceId
- sessionId
- deviceLabel
- status
- createdAt
- lastActivityAt
- expiresAt

Use an atomic transaction for session creation.

The backend must validate the session on protected requests.

Use a configurable inactivity timeout. Start with 30 minutes as the proposed default.

Do not trust localStorage device identifiers as a security mechanism.

